---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About">
  <div class="page prose">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>
      Good Stuff Doctrine documents a way of building and playing Magic decks: give up
      synergy for a high floor, fill the deck with cards that are strong on their own,
      and trade one-for-one until you grind out the late game.
    </p>
    <p>Write your own story here: how you found the playstyle and which decks you have played it with.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
